<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-prŏpĕrus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>too quick</i> or <i>hasty</i>, <i>over-hasty</i>, <i>sudden</i>, <i>precipitate</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praepropera festinatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 7, 8, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prensatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Att. 1, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">celeritas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					31, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingenium,</span>”
				<i>rash</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nisus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					15, 757</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 6, 3, 6</span></i>
			.— Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeprŏpĕrē</span></b> , <i>very quickly</i>, <i>very
			hastily</i>, <i>with over-haste</i> (rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic. or Cæs.): peri
					praepropere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 2, 4, 10</span></i>
			 (v. Ritschl ad h. l.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">festinans praepropere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 37, 23, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">raptim omnia praepropere agendo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 19, 10</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 12, 6, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Oth. 8</span></i>.</div>
